<speak>The files open properly. Enlarging text on the phone sometimes means I lose the heading, but that is mostly why I prefer the computer for careful reading. I would not want a separate simplified version sent to me automatically. It could become another document to keep track of. If I encounter a file I cannot use, I will ask about that particular file. For now, a clear route to the original material is the useful part. I have made a note of that in my notebook.</speak>